  <metadata>
    <name>Garmisch, the first 6 km</name>
    <desc>The desktop harness ride. The first 6 km of the parity route trekking-garmisch-innsbruck as
    brouter.de planned it (app/brouter/parity), timed by its own per-point times, with one 45 s stop
    after 2.5 km so the camera has to fall back to the compass.</desc>
  </metadata>
